OL,3,GNEWSA'My experience of tragedy on 9/11
OL,4,Agave me a second family'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was a series of sliding doors
OL,7,Fmoments that led us to each other and
OL,8,Ffrom something so tragic, came an
OL,9,Fenduring, special friendship."
OL,11,FOn 11 September 2001, Louise Rayner was
OL,12,Fliving with the Lawrence family in
OL,13,FSummit, New Jersey. Then in her
OL,14,Fmid-20s, she was working as a nanny for
OL,15,FBob and Suzanne Lawrence's two
OL,16,Fchildren.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
