OL,3,GNEWSA'My experience of tragedy on 9/11
OL,4,Agave me a second family'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLouise was a photography student from
OL,7,FBradford, but ended up forming a
OL,8,Flifelong bond with the Lawrences after
OL,9,FBob, 41, was killed in the attacks on
OL,10,Fthe World Trade Center, just one day
OL,11,Fafter starting a new job on the 104th
OL,12,Ffloor of the South Tower.
OL,14,FShe ended up staying with the Lawrences
OL,15,Ffor a further two and a half years to
OL,16,Fhelp in the aftermath of the atrocity
OL,17,Fand they remain close today.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
